### Get all users (copy an id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users

### Get available cars (copy an id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cars/available


### Available electric cars only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/cars/available/electric

### Book a car
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "5b4b2cd1-15f0-45b7-8b8d-833069d8f761",
  "carId": "50ab755e-d2e9-4e88-af89-87dbdc9fd4ee",
  "startDate": "2026-10-20",
  "endDate": "2026-10-23"
}

### View all bookings (pick a booking id for DELETE below)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings

### View bookings for one user (paste user id from GET /api/v1/users)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/user/<uuid>

### Cancel/delete a booking (paste booking id from GET /api/v1/bookings or POST response)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/bookings/b62ca20b-ae22-4b42-8ca2-58b3611c1419